ption value="originZoneGroup">Grupo de zona de origen</option><option value="destZoneGroup">Grupo de zona de destino</option><option value="overnightNights">Noches de pernocta</option><option value="weekday">Día de la semana</option></select></div></div><div class="w-44"><div class="w-full"><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="EQ">= igual a</option><option value="NEQ">≠ distinto de</option><option value="GT">&gt; mayor que</option><option value="GTE">≥ mayor o igual que</option><option value="LT">&lt; menor que</option><option value="LTE">≤ menor o igual que</option><option value="IN">está en la lista</option><option value="BETWEEN">está entre</option></select></div></div><div class="flex-1 min-w-32"><div class="w-full"><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="20" value=""></div></div></div><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm " type="button"><i class="ri-delete-bin-line"></i></button></div></div><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm " type="button"><i class="ri-add-line mr-1"></i> Agregar condición</button></div></section><section class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-3">¿Cuánto suma o resta?</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 items-start"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Operador *</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="FIXED">Monto fijo</option><option value="TIMES">Por cada (×)</option><option value="PER_BLOCK">Cada N unidades (÷)</option><option value="PERCENT">Porcentaje (%)</option><option value="TIERED">Por escalones</option><option value="RATE_TABLE">Tarifa de tabla</option></select></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Variable *</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="">Elegir variable…</option><option value="km">Distancia (km)</option><option value="clientCount">Paradas completadas</option><option value="weightKg">Peso (kg)</option><option value="durationHours">Duración (h)</option><option value="truckVolumeM3">Volumen del camión (m³)</option><option value="truckWeightTons">Capacidad del camión (t)</option><option value="overnightNights">Noches de pernocta</option><option value="weekday">Día de la semana</option></select></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Importe en VES *</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="20.00" value="0"></div></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Efecto *</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="INCREASE">Aumenta el costo</option><option value="DECREASE">Disminuye el costo</option></select></div></div><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">Multiplica la variable por el importe. Ej: por cada peaje, $20.</p><div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Piso — no baja de (VES)</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="sin piso" value=""></div></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Tope — no pasa de (VES)</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="sin tope" value=""></div></div></div><div class="mt-4 bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 space-y-2"><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="ri-double-quotes-l text-teal-600 mt-0.5"></i><p class="text-sm text-teal-900 font-medium">Por cada unidad de paradas completadas se suma 0 VES.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1"><span class="text-xs text-teal-700">Variables usadas:</span><span class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap font-medium rounded-full bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs ">Paradas completadas</span></div></div><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-end gap-3"><div class="w-56"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Probar con paradas completadas =</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " type="number" value="10"></div></div></div><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm " type="button"><i class="ri-flask-line mr-1"></i> Probar</button></div></section><section class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-4 space-y-3"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5"><label for="rule-description" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Descripción</label></div><textarea id="rule-description" rows="2" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500">Por cada unidad de paradas completadas se suma 0 VES.</textarea><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Se escribe sola desde el cálculo. Editala si querés otra redacción.</p></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Motivo</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="Acuerdo con el transportista de agosto 2026" value=""></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Desde y hasta cuándo rige</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-3">Se compara contra la <strong>fecha del viaje</strong>, no contra hoy. Un viaje de agosto se sigue liquidando con la tarifa de agosto aunque el acuerdo ya haya cambiado. Dejalas vacías si la regla no tiene vencimiento.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Rige desde</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " type="date" value=""></div></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Rige hasta</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " type="date" value=""></div></div></div><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">Ambos días quedan <strong>incluidos</strong>. Vencerla no es lo mismo que desactivarla: una regla vencida sigue aplicando a los viajes anteriores a su fecha de fin, y una inactiva no aplica a ninguno.</p></section><section class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-3">Cómo convive con las demás reglas</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Etapa del cálculo *</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="BASE">Base (precio base de la ruta)</option><option value="VARIABLE">Variable (cliente / kg / bulto)</option><option value="MODIFIER">Modificador (ajuste por servicio)</option><option value="SURCHARGE">Recargo (pernocta, peajes y otros variables propios)</option><option value="ADJUSTMENT">Ajuste (descuentos/penalidades)</option><option value="TAX">Impuesto</option></select></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">¿Se suma o compite? *</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="SUM">Se suma a las demás</option><option value="MAX">Compite: gana la de monto más alto del grupo</option><option value="EXCLUSIVE">Compite: gana la de mayor prioridad</option></select></div><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700 pb-2 cursor-pointer"><input class="rounded border-slate-300 text-teal-600 focus:ring-teal-500" type="checkbox" checked="">Regla activa</label></div></section><div class="flex justify-end gap-3 pt-2 border-t border-gray-200 px-6 pb-6"><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm " type="button">Cancelar</button><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-700 text-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md px-4 py-2 text-sm " type="submit">Crear regla</button></div></form></div></div></div>"`;

