ocus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="COUNTRY">Todas las compañías del país</option><option value="PARTY">Solo una compañía</option></select></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">¿Cuándo aplica?</h3><div class="flex gap-1 bg-gray-100 rounded-lg p-1"><button type="button" class="px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded-md transition-colors bg-white text-teal-700 shadow-sm">Siempre</button><button type="button" class="px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded-md transition-colors text-gray-600">Si se cumple…</button><button type="button" class="px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded-md transition-colors text-gray-600">JSON</button></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-3">¿Cuánto suma o resta?</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 items-start"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Operador *</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="FIXED">Monto fijo</option><option value="TIMES">Por cada (×)</option><option value="PER_BLOCK">Cada N unidades (÷)</option><option value="PERCENT">Porcentaje (%)</option><option value="TIERED">Por escalones</option><option value="RATE_TABLE">Tarifa de tabla</option></select></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Respaldo en VES *</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="20.00" value="0"></div></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Efecto *</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="INCREASE">Aumenta el costo</option><option value="DECREASE">Disminuye el costo</option></select></div></div><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">El importe sale de un tarifario cargado aparte. Acá se elige cuál y cuánto cobrar si el viaje no casa ninguna fila.</p><div class="mt-3 space-y-2"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">¿De qué tarifario sale el importe? *</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="">Elegir tarifario…</option><option value="ZONAS">ZONAS — Tarifas por zona (Zona de origen · Zona de destino)</option></select></div><p class="text-xs text-gray-500">El <strong>respaldo</strong> es lo que se cobra si el viaje no casa ninguna fila del tarifario. Queda anotado en el desglose cuando pasa, así que un viaje sin cobertura se ve en vez de liquidarse en silencio.</p></div><div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Piso — no baja de (VES)</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="sin piso" value=""></div></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Tope — no pasa de (VES)</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="sin tope" value=""></div></div></div><div class="mt-4 bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 space-y-2"><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="ri-double-quotes-l text-teal-600 mt-0.5"></i><p class="text-sm text-teal-900 font-medium">Se suma el importe que diga el tarifario  (y 0 VES si el viaje no está en la tabla).</p></div></div><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-end gap-3"><div class="w-56"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Probar con paradas completadas =</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " type="number" value="10"></div></div></div><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm " type="button"><i class="ri-flask-line mr-1"></i> Probar</button></div></section><section class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-4 space-y-3"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5"><label for="rule-description" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Descripción</label></div><textarea id="rule-description" rows="2" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500">Se suma el importe que diga el tarifario  (y 0 VES si el viaje no está en la tabla).</textarea><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Se escribe sola desde el cálculo. Editala si querés otra redacción.</p></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Motivo</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " placeholder="Acuerdo con el transportista de agosto 2026" value=""></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Desde y hasta cuándo rige</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-3">Se compara contra la <strong>fecha del viaje</strong>, no contra hoy. Un viaje de agosto se sigue liquidando con la tarifa de agosto aunque el acuerdo ya haya cambiado. Dejalas vacías si la regla no tiene vencimiento.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Rige desde</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " type="date" value=""></div></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Rige hasta</label><div class="relative"><input id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all   " type="date" value=""></div></div></div><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">Ambos días quedan <strong>incluidos</strong>. Vencerla no es lo mismo que desactivarla: una regla vencida sigue aplicando a los viajes anteriores a su fecha de fin, y una inactiva no aplica a ninguno.</p></section><section class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-3">Cómo convive con las demás reglas</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">Etapa del cálculo *</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="BASE">Base (precio base de la ruta)</option><option value="VARIABLE">Variable (cliente / kg / bulto)</option><option value="MODIFIER">Modificador (ajuste por servicio)</option><option value="SURCHARGE">Recargo (pernocta, peajes y otros variables propios)</option><option value="ADJUSTMENT">Ajuste (descuentos/penalidades)</option><option value="TAX">Impuesto</option></select></div><div class="w-full"><label for="_r_ID_" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1.5">¿Se suma o compite? *</label><select id="_r_ID_" class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm border border-slate-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500 focus:border-transparent transition-all cursor-pointer  "><option value="SUM">Se suma a las demás</option><option value="MAX">Compite: gana la de monto más alto del grupo</option><option value="EXCLUSIVE">Compite: gana la de mayor prioridad</option></select></div><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-700 pb-2 cursor-pointer"><input class="rounded border-slate-300 text-teal-600 focus:ring-teal-500" type="checkbox" checked="">Regla activa</label></div></section><div class="flex justify-end gap-3 pt-2 border-t border-gray-200 px-6 pb-6"><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm " type="button">Cancelar</button><button class="whitespace-nowrap inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-medium rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-700 text-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md px-4 py-2 text-sm " type="submit">Crear regla</button></div></form></div></div></div>"`;

